abstract: "Research prototype for byte-preserving DICOM exchange using ML-KEM-768, HKDF-SHA-256, AES-256-GCM, ML-DSA-65, a custom Merkle-style log, signed checkpoints, and witness-quorum checks. Includes selected regression tests, symbolic models, and sanitized experimental summaries. The prototype is not clinically validated or intended for production use."
